{"id":"153f6e55df144344","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-semisimple.md","title":"Semisimple Module","display":"df-semisimple — Semisimple Module","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-semisimple","aliases":["58-df-semisimple"],"display":"df-semisimple — Semisimple Module","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-semisimple"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-semisimple</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semisimple — Semisimple Module"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e309a228bb19c798\" href=\"?note=e309a228bb19c798\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md\">../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,M,N,P,I,S,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\">\\(R,M,N,P,I,S,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Submodule}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4deff85a84639467\" href=\"?note=4deff85a84639467\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md\">../batch07/58-df-submodule.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e309a228bb19c798\" href=\"?note=e309a228bb19c798\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md\">../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DirectComplementStructure}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{DirectComplementStructure}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SemisimpleStructure}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SemisimpleStructure}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Semisimple}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{SemisimpleDecomposition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Semisimple}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{SemisimpleDecomposition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (compatibility predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple\\text{-}complement}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{DirectComplementStructure}_S(N,P;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\\\&amp;\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(P;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\&amp;\\land N\\cap P=\\{0_M\\}\\land M=\\{+_M(\\langle n,p\\rangle):n\\in N\\land p\\in P\\}.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple\\text{-}complement}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{DirectComplementStructure}_S(N,P;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\\\&amp;\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\land\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(P;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\&amp;\\land N\\cap P=\\{0_M\\}\\land M=\\{+_M(\\langle n,p\\rangle):n\\in N\\land p\\in P\\}.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{SemisimpleStructure}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall N\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\to\\exists P\\subseteq M\\;\\operatorname{DirectComplementStructure}_S(N,P;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{SemisimpleStructure}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall N\\subseteq M\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Submodule}_S(N;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\to\\exists P\\subseteq M\\;\\operatorname{DirectComplementStructure}_S(N,P;M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{Semisimple}(M,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\operatorname{SemisimpleStructure}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{Semisimple}(M,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\operatorname{SemisimpleStructure}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{SemisimpleDecomposition}_S(M,R,S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,I,\\mathcal P(M))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(S(i),R,+_M\\!\\upharpoonright S(i)^2,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\!\\upharpoonright(R\\times S(i)))\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall m\\in M\\;\\exists J\\subseteq I\\;\\exists c\\in M^J\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(J)\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;(c(j)\\in S(j))\\land m=\\sum_{j\\in J}^{+_M}c(j)\\\\&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall J&#39;\\subseteq I\\;\\forall c&#39;\\in M^{J&#39;}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(J&#39;)\\land\\forall j\\in J&#39;\\;(c&#39;(j)\\in S(j))\\land m=\\sum_{j\\in J&#39;}^{+_M}c&#39;(j)\\to\\{\\langle j,c(j)\\rangle:j\\in J\\land c(j)\\neq0_M\\}=\\{\\langle j,c&#39;(j)\\rangle:j\\in J&#39;\\land c&#39;(j)\\neq0_M\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash{}&amp;\\operatorname{SemisimpleDecomposition}_S(M,R,S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,I,\\mathcal P(M))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{SimpleModule}_S(S(i),R,+_M\\!\\upharpoonright S(i)^2,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\!\\upharpoonright(R\\times S(i)))\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall m\\in M\\;\\exists J\\subseteq I\\;\\exists c\\in M^J\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(J)\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;(c(j)\\in S(j))\\land m=\\sum_{j\\in J}^{+_M}c(j)\\\\&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall J&#39;\\subseteq I\\;\\forall c&#39;\\in M^{J&#39;}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(J&#39;)\\land\\forall j\\in J&#39;\\;(c&#39;(j)\\in S(j))\\land m=\\sum_{j\\in J&#39;}^{+_M}c&#39;(j)\\to\\{\\langle j,c(j)\\rangle:j\\in J\\land c(j)\\neq0_M\\}=\\{\\langle j,c&#39;(j)\\rangle:j\\in J&#39;\\land c&#39;(j)\\neq0_M\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Semisimple modules are direct sums of simple submodules.</li>\n<li>All submodules of semisimple modules are also semisimple.</li>\n<li>Wedderburn--Artin: a semisimple Artinian ring is a finite product of matrix rings over division rings.</li>\n<li>All complements and simple summands now share one nine-argument module structure. The former carrier-level projections could independently choose incompatible additions, zeros, and scalar actions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"e309a228bb19c798","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S:V^9\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-submodule.md","status":"resolved","id":"4deff85a84639467","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Submodule}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-submodule.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-simple-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"e309a228bb19c798","anchor":"re